    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 75 Monasterboice Road, a wonderful two bedroom property presented in excellent condition. This fine family home has been renovated throughout the years, while it may benefit from some upgrades, it offers an excellent opportunity for the new home owner to put their own stamp on the property.\n\nAccommodation downstairs comprises of a brief entrance hall, spacious living room, kitchen with bathroom off. Upstairs are two spacious bedrooms.\n\nThe location is second to none in terms of convenience with a host of amenities closeby in Kimmage and Crumlin including shops, Eamonn Ceannt Park, Our Lady's Children's Hospital and many established primary and secondary schools. This property is walking distance from the city centre and is serviced by excellent road and bus routes. Public transport is well catered for as bus routes 17, 18, 15, 83 and 150 are all a short stroll away.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 3.29m x 4.55m\n\n\nKitchen - 4.12m x 2.24m\n\n\nDining Room - 2.39m x 3.02m\n\n\nBathroom - 1.42m x 3.02m\n\n\nBedroom - 4.12m x 3.20m\n\n\nBedroom - 4.12m x 3.13m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two bedroom mid terrace property</li><li> Extending to approx. 70sqm</li><li> Double glazed windows throughout</li><li> Ideal location</li><li> Private rear garden</li><li> Ample on street car parking</li><li> D2 BER</li><li> Easy access to Dublin City Centre</ul>"
      },
